      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "None. The registry binds it to its own summarizer role, whose tool profile is empty, and the kernel catalog groups it under knowledge with phase worker-summary, beside the two librarians. Its source lives under agents/knowledge because its output is knowledge-system rows."
        }
